              "text": "हिमपातः — himapātaḥ — \"a snowfall\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पर्वते रात्रौ हिमपातः भवति। parvate rātrau himapātaḥ bhavati. There is a snowfall on the mountain at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हिमपातः (himapātaḥ) is built from hima, \"snow\", and pāta, \"a fall\", from the root √pat, \"to fall\", which also gives patati, \"falls\"; MW gives the compound as a fall of snow (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
